# App checks

When Aaron says check or run checks, that is the phone app.

Run `npm run ios:prepare:store`. That is `npm run check`, `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, then the iOS bundle export. Do not skip one of them.

When Aaron asks to fix something, change the phone code. That is `native/`, the iOS widget in `widgets/`, and the Android widget. Do not fix the website instead, and do not stop after a website walk.

The website at port 48741 is a different program. A click there does not show that the phone menu, cheer, shop, or widget works.

Say which commands passed. Say if the change is not in the TestFlight build he has installed. Do not say the phone works unless a phone showed it.
